# Witness: marks inside a block quote

HUMAN_REVIEW.md opens with a quoted status banner, so a quoted list item, table row or heading
is this document set's own idiom rather than an exotic shape. Stripping the quote markers
before a line is classified is what keeps all three inside the rule; without it the line begins
with a quote marker and matches none of the three branches.

